# Shortcuts: a sequence of keys, then | and a name.
# Keys are MIDI note numbers (middle C is 60). A sequence of 1 to 3 keys is
# recognized after 2 seconds of silence; a longer one the moment it is played.
# Add and remove shortcuts from Telegram with /seqlearn, /seqadd and /seqdel,
# or edit this file directly: the bridge reloads it when it changes.
#
# No shortcuts are shipped. Add your own, one per line, for example:
# 60 62 64|my_cue
